+ * JXF23 CMOS Image Sensor Driver
+ *
+ * The register sequences and gain table are adapted from the Ingenic
+ * vendor sensor driver (sensor_jxf23_t31).
+ *
+ * WARNING: this driver has not been validated on hardware. Only the SC2336
+ * driver has been tested on a camera.
+ */
